        {"class": "DepictionHeaderView", "title": "主要功能", "useBoldText": true},
        {"class": "DepictionMarkdownView", "markdown": "- 在 Hello 键盘侠截图操作栏中加入“长截图”和“拼图”按钮。\n\n- 长截图调用 StayShot 长截图引擎。\n\n- 拼图使用 Hello 自带引擎，仅处理内存中的最近截图。\n\n- 不新增截图入口、窗口或菜单。", "useSpacing": true, "useRawFormat": false},
        {"class": "DepictionSeparatorView"},
        {"class": "DepictionHeaderView", "title": "兼容性", "useBoldText": true},
        {"class": "DepictionMarkdownView", "markdown": "- 适用于 RootHide，软件包架构为 `iphoneos-arm64e`。\n\n- 需要 Hello 键盘侠、StayShot 长截图引擎及 MobileSubstrate。", "useSpacing": true, "useRawFormat": false},
        {"class": "DepictionSeparatorView"},
        {"class": "DepictionHeaderView", "title": "使用说明", "useBoldText": true},
        {"class": "DepictionMarkdownView", "markdown": "- 功能入口位于 Hello 键盘侠的截图操作栏。\n\n- 拼图功能不读取相册、不访问剪贴板，也不写入临时文件。\n\n- StayShot 引擎会作为依赖一同安装。", "useSpacing": true, "useRawFormat": false},
